    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16919" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσχολ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχολή</span>) of persons, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without leisure, engaged, busy,</i><i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				832b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				3.27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. συγγόνου προσεδρίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					93
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἐς σοφίην</span>
			<i>busily engaged</i> upon (or, <i>with no leisure</i> for) . .
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.77
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. περί τι</span>
			<i>busy</i> about . . , <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τοῖς ἔργοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1305a20
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <i>having no time to</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				8.29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσχολοί εἰσιν ἐπιβουλεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1313b20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ὥστε μὴ
			ἐκκλησιάζειν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1318b12
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λως, ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					33.25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				42
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				61
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of actions,
			etc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα χρόνον ἄ. ποιεῖν</span>”
				<i>fully occupied,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					831c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. πράξεις</span>”
				<i>not leisured,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1177b8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνησις ἄ.</span>”
				<i>unresting,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cael.</u>
					284a31
				</span></i>
			.</div>
